    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We are all familiar with the saying \"practice makes perfect\". To make sure that professionals have all the necessary skills at the time of any crisis, simulated practice is crucial in order to deliver perfect care. At the Centre for Innovation in Medical Education, CIME, Aga Khan university has the perfect environments and skills to simulate the contexts of any crisis situation to help develop expertise in its clinicians.",
